    k n t b⁻¹ _ _ (contra (src (ν * b) σ)) (contra π) hnt sb.inv (isUnitaryChar_inv ub) (isSmooth_contra _)
    (hI k n V _ a1 a2).1 (hU k n V _ a1 a2 a3).1 (isSmooth_contra _) (hI k _ W π hs' hi').1
    (hP k n (n + t) ν b V W σ π sν sb hs' hL)

